    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d765">

                <pb facs="1240" n="1226" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1226"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/12–2644: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Political Adviser, Allied Force Headquarters</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-12-26T20:00:00-04:00">December 26,
                            1944—8 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. For Berry. American Interests—Rumania. Reurtel 34 November 27.<anchor n="14"
                        xml:id="d765-f1"/> To extent your facilities permit you are hereby
                    authorized to accept messages from American nationals to be forwarded to
                    Department in paraphrase by airgram.</p>
                <p>With regard to possible repatriation of American nationals in Rumania, please
                    discuss question with AmPolad, and ascertain the views of the Allied Control
                    Commission and appropriate Rumanian authorities, keeping Department informed of
                    all developments, particularly difficulties to be overcome, in order that it may
                    at any given moment be able to assess current situation and handle inquiries
                    adequately. Department has drawn up list of priorities for use in connection
                    with eventual repatriation of American nationals from Italy which you should
                    obtain from AmPolad for use in registering applicants appearing before you.</p>
                <p>Remainder your 34 has been subject of telegram to Legation Bern.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d765-f1" n="14" xml:id="d765-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; Mr. Berry reported the desire of a score of Americans for
                    information concerning their early repatriation (340.1115A/11–2744).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
